* {{sense|Egyptian unit of measure}} {{l|en|ro}} {{qualifier|{{frac|32}} hin}}; {{l|en|khay}} {{qualifier|{{frac|3}} hin}}; {{l|en|hekat}}, {{l|en|heqat}} {{qualifier|10 hins}}; {{l|en|khar}} {{qualifier|100 hins, later 160 or 200 hins}}

